        "5.4 Build a balanced development map\nUse this table to identify which domains support your most important goal.\n| Domain | Current strength | Relevance to my goal | Next development step |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Main professional skill | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Communication | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Emotional understanding | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Leadership or collaboration | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Business or financial understanding | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Health and energy management | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Culture and social understanding | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |\n| Historical and long-term perspective | 1–5 | 1–5 |  |",
