        "Template A: The five-dimensional analysis\nProblem or decision:",
        "1. Line\n- Which domain am I using?\n- What do I know?\n- What am I missing?\n2. Level\n- Am I conforming, individualising, synthesising, or generating?\n- Which assumptions am I treating as facts?\n- What competing model deserves examination?\n3. Altitude\n- Which other domains influence this problem?\n- What capability may be the hidden constraint?\n- What important part of the wider system am I overlooking?\n4. Four perspectives\n- Individual inner:\n- Individual outer:\n- Collective inner:\n- Collective outer:\n5. History and time\n- How did the situation develop?\n- What patterns or transitions are relevant?\n- What should be preserved?\n- What future scenarios are plausible?\nIdentity check\n- What part of my identity feels threatened?\n- What evidence would change my mind?\nDecision\n- Options:\n- Trade-offs:\n- Smallest useful test:\n- Review date:",
